{"chars": "When you pick up a Storm Globe and turn it slowly in your hands, the little storm inside wakes up. Snowflakes swirl. Wind whirls. Some globes hold fierce gray blizzards that spin and tumble. Some hold soft, sparkly snowfalls that drift down slow as feathers. One holds a pink sunrise over fresh snow, and one holds a night of falling stars. And if you hold a Storm Globe up to your ear, the way you'd listen to a seashell, you can hear the wind of that winter, whistling very, very softly, whoooooo, from far away and long ago.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.475, 0.475, 0.475, 0.475, 0.475, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.762, 0.762, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 1.275, 1.275, 1.275, 1.275, 1.275, 1.275, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 2.138, 2.138, 2.138, 2.288, 2.288, 2.288, 2.288, 2.288, 2.288, 2.288, 2.712, 2.712, 2.712, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.975, 2.975, 2.975, 2.975, 2.975, 2.975, 3.7, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.6, 4.6, 4.6, 4.6, 4.6, 4.6, 4.6, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.475, 5.475, 5.475, 6.125, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 6.925, 7.675, 7.787, 7.787, 7.787, 7.787, 7.787, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.113, 8.925, 9.037, 9.037, 9.037, 9.037, 9.037, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.3, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.438, 10.438, 10.438, 10.438, 10.438, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 10.7, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.387, 11.387, 11.387, 11.387, 11.387, 11.838, 11.838, 11.838, 11.838, 12.012, 12.012, 12.012, 12.012, 12.012, 12.012, 12.012, 12.75, 12.863, 12.863, 12.863, 12.863, 12.863, 13.1, 13.1, 13.1, 13.1, 13.1, 13.425, 13.425, 13.425, 13.425, 13.425, 13.975, 14.088, 14.088, 14.088, 14.088, 14.088, 14.0